      "titre": "Application du TCL",
      "domaine": "Probabilités",
      "niveau": "Moyen",
      "enonce": "1000 lancers de pièce. P(480 ≤ S ≤ 520) ?",
      "indication": "TCL avec μ = 500, σ = √250.",
      "solution": [
        "S₁₀₀₀ : E[S] = 500, σ(S) = √250 ≈ 15.81.",
        "TCL : Z = (S - 500)/15.81 ≈ N(0,1).",
        "P(480 ≤ S ≤ 520) = P(-1.27 ≤ Z ≤ 1.27)",
        "= 2Φ(1.27) - 1 ≈ 0.796 ≈ 80%."
      ],
